UID:indico-event-15280@indico.global
URL:https://indico.global/event/15280/
CREATED:20250917T114358Z
DESCRIPTION:Speakers: Damir Bosnar\n\n Zagreb\, 03. - 05. 12. 2025\n \nThe 
 goal of the workshop is to bring together experimental and theoretical phys
 icists working at the forefront of the fundamental exotic atoms research an
 d their applications and thus provide a dynamic forum for the exchange of t
 he latest research results.\nSince precise radiation detection presents a c
 rucial condition for these endeavors\, the advances in these techniques wil
 l be presented and discussed.\nThe workshop is expected to stimulate new id
 eas and collaborations across disciplines.\nThe venue of the workshop is th
 e Department of Physics\, Faculty of Science\, University of Zagreb\, Zagre
 b\, Croatia.\n\n \n\nhttps://indico.global/event/15280/
LAST-MODIFIED:20251101T092043Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Exotic atoms: fundamental aspects\, applications and advances in ra
 diation detectors
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
